SELECTION CRITERIA:
We included randomized controlled trials (RCTs) that evaluated PPV with ILM peeling versus PPV with inverted ILM flap 
for treatment of large MHs (with a basal diameter greater than 400 µm at the narrowest point measured by optical 
coherence tomography) of any type (idiopathic, traumatic, or myopic).

